            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Dracon's Early Life</strong><br>\nLittle is known about Dracon's early life, as with many ancient figures. He was born in Athens, Greece, at some point in the 7th century BCE. The lack of details about his personal life, including the exact year of his birth, has made Dracon a somewhat mysterious figure. However, what distinguished him in history were his contributions to the legal system of ancient Athens.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Athens Before Dracon</strong><br>\nBefore Dracon's legal reforms, Athens had no written laws. Disputes were settled by aristocratic rulers, and their judgments could be inconsistent or biased. This often led to conflicts and an unstable society. People's rights and duties were not clearly defined, making it difficult for citizens to understand the legal boundaries of their actions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Dracon's Appointment</strong><br>\nThe Athenian people, seeking to create order within their chaotic society, appointed Dracon to document and systematize the laws. Dracon was chosen because he was considered a wise and fair-minded individual. The appointment of Dracon as a lawgiver marked a shift towards a codified system of justice in Athens.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
